Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/ec.c
Line: 282
Function: ec_main
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: The result of OSSL_ENCODER_CTX_new_for_pkey() (ectx at line 269) is not checked for NULL before being passed to OSSL_ENCODER_to_bio() at line 282. If ectx is NULL (e.g., due to allocation failure), this may lead to a NULL dereference inside the OpenSSL library.

